---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - SaveScribd">
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-16 text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] flex-1">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6 text-[#171717] dark:text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed">
      <p>Last updated: November 2026</p>
      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white pt-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using SaveScribd (savescribd.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our service.</p>
      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white pt-4">2. Permitted Use & Fair Use</h2>
      <p>SaveScribd is designed exclusively as an archival, educational, and accessibility utility to assist researchers, students, and educators in retrieving and reviewing documents. You agree not to use this service for unauthorized commercial redistribution.</p>
      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white pt-4">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>The service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranty of any kind, either express or implied.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
